    - Root Cause: SupportScreen rendered ticket cards using `key={ticket._id}`. When tickets returned from the API lacked an `_id` field (e.g. returned `id` instead or missing `_id`), every child in the list received `key={undefined}`, triggering React's list reconciliation key warning in ScrollView.
