      4. Updated `handleSubmit` to pass `{ subject: cleanSubject, category, message: cleanMessage, source: "mobile" }`.
      5. Enhanced error handling to surface dynamic backend `ApiError` messages.
      6. Wrapped form container in `KeyboardAvoidingView` with `keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled"` and `TouchableWithoutFeedback` keyboard dismiss.
      7. Registered `API_CONFIG.ENDPOINTS.CONTACT` (`SUBMIT` and `MY_MESSAGES`) in `constants/config.ts`.
    - Verification:
      - Live API: verified `POST /api/contact` returns `200 OK` ("Message sent successfully. Our team will get back to you soon.") and confirmed persistence via `GET /api/contact/my`.
